! GPSS Advanced Tool - Discrete Event Simulation Framework
! This program models a complex queueing network and resource allocation system.

! Define simulation parameters
START 1000

! Queue definitions
QUEUE CUSTOMER, 50
QUEUE SERVER1, 10
QUEUE SERVER2, 10

! Resource definitions
RESOURCE STAFF, 5
RESOURCE MACHINE, 3

! Simulation logic
GENERATE 10, 2, 0, 0
ADVANCE 5, 2
QUEUE CUSTOMER
SEIZE STAFF
QUEUE SERVER1
DEPART CUSTOMER
SEIZE MACHINE
ADVANCE 15, 5
DEPART SERVER1
RELEASE STAFF
RELEASE MACHINE
TERMINATE 0

! Analysis and reporting
REPORT
PRINT SIMULATION RESULTS
PRINT QUEUE STATISTICS
PRINT RESOURCE UTILIZATION
PRINT SIMULATION TIME

! End of simulation
END
